.DS_Store
node_modules/
build/
dist/
.svelte-kit/
.netlify/
/package
.wrangler
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*
vite.config.js.timestamp-*
vite.config.ts.timestamp-*
# The plugin's source map. code.js *is* committed (it is what Figma loads), but its map is
# only ever read by `npm run sourcemaps:upload --workspace plugin` right after a build, so
# committing 100 kB of generated JSON that changes on every build would be pure noise.
plugin/code.js.map
certificates/
.ssh
.turbo/
# Playwright's run artifacts: the HTML report, and the traces/screenshots kept for
# failures. CI uploads them as an artifact instead.
playwright-report/
test-results/
# Per-run scratch: the resolved test subjects, and the live target's signed-in session.
# The latter is a real credential — it must never be committed.
e2e/playwright/
